  {
   "type": "italic",
   "text": "Three texts, six instruments, one method on all three islands."
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Before going on site, each group read one text on public life and turned it into two field instruments, called toolkits. Every group then used all six, the same way, in its own area. We surveyed each island on two days, one weekday and one rest day, each in three blocks: 10:00 to 12:00, 16:00 to 18:00 and 20:00 to 22:00. Because the method is the same, the three islands can be set side by side."
  },
